WEBVTT

00:06.550 --> 00:08.320
Be a good girl.

00:10.430 --> 00:11.750
Pet.

00:20.490 --> 00:21.990
And she's down!

00:21.990 --> 00:23.700
Impressive as always, Mr. Suzuki.

00:23.700 --> 00:27.140
The more pure they are, 
the sooner they fall to your skill.

00:27.140 --> 00:30.800
Your purity backfired this time, elf woman.

00:31.330 --> 00:34.280
Hey! What did you do to Annette?!

00:34.890 --> 00:36.450
It's too late.

00:36.450 --> 00:41.510
Mr. Suzuki's skill unconditionally 
turns anyone he pets into his slave.

00:41.840 --> 00:43.610
It does what?

00:47.910 --> 00:49.660
Dispel it this instant!

00:49.660 --> 00:52.230
Eek! Violence is wrong!

00:53.630 --> 00:55.990
Calm yourself, alley cat.

00:59.430 --> 01:02.540
Whew. Thanks, Suzuki-san.

01:04.230 --> 01:10.390
No human or monster can resist 
my overpowered skill "Pet"!

01:13.340 --> 01:15.560
That's enough, Suzuki!

01:16.200 --> 01:17.760
Oh, it's you, Ysha.

01:18.010 --> 01:22.170
I don't recall teaching you 
to use your Gift that way.

01:23.810 --> 01:27.590
The town of Veil will never surrender to you!

01:27.590 --> 01:29.900
Yeah! Ms. Ysha is right!

01:29.900 --> 01:31.940
We're not gonna obey you!

01:31.940 --> 01:32.620
Yeah!

01:32.620 --> 01:33.880
Get your head out of your ass!

01:33.880 --> 01:35.020
Is that right?

01:35.330 --> 01:41.500
Then I shall destroy your town 
completely and build a new kingdom.

01:41.500 --> 01:44.210
Run them down, my pets!

01:47.130 --> 01:48.840
Help!

01:49.180 --> 01:50.600
You bastard...

01:51.000 --> 01:53.820
Don't call me that.

01:53.820 --> 01:58.260
Call me "hero" like you did when we first met.

01:59.840 --> 02:01.010
Wait, Suzuki!

02:01.320 --> 02:02.850
You should be happy, Ysha.

02:02.850 --> 02:06.710
I shall use your church as my castle.

02:08.410 --> 02:09.930
Damn it.

03:32.920 --> 03:36.420
<b>No Longer Allowed               in Another World</b>

03:36.420 --> 03:37.720
<b>[ No Longer Allowed               in Another World ]</b>

03:37.720 --> 03:41.010
<b>[ No Longer Allowed               in Another World ]</b>

03:58.370 --> 04:00.930
Annette was right.

04:00.930 --> 04:05.670
There's no telling when or 
by whom we'll be attacked.

04:14.000 --> 04:16.390
Have you had enough?

04:22.950 --> 04:23.930
Beware of Wildcat

04:31.620 --> 04:33.590
D-Damn it...

04:34.240 --> 04:36.420
Hello. We meet again.

04:36.420 --> 04:37.980
Oh, it's you.

04:37.980 --> 04:41.370
You see? That's what Other 
Worlders are really like.

04:41.810 --> 04:45.420
Not only did he use his Gift 
for his selfish desires,

04:45.420 --> 04:49.070
but now his greed has become completely 
unstoppable and he's lost control.

04:49.550 --> 04:54.020
Suzuki wasn't like that 
when he came to this world.

04:54.350 --> 04:57.470
He was a quiet, weak-willed man.

05:03.040 --> 05:04.300
I see.

05:04.300 --> 05:06.830
Why are you taking notes?

05:08.190 --> 05:10.140
How truly interesting.

05:10.140 --> 05:14.290
He's exactly the kind of man 
who excites my sensitivities.

05:15.740 --> 05:17.110
Where is he now?

05:17.460 --> 05:19.790
He headed toward the church.

05:19.790 --> 05:23.330
I see. Look after Tama, please.

05:23.330 --> 05:24.100
Wait!

05:24.100 --> 05:26.360
You don't have a Gift, do you?

05:26.360 --> 05:27.720
What are you going to do?

05:33.630 --> 05:39.670
I have a feeling I'll finally be 
able to write my masterpiece.

05:41.690 --> 05:43.660
W-Wait, Sensei.

05:44.150 --> 05:45.850
I'll go with you.

05:51.780 --> 05:54.970
Isn't this exciting, Ysha?

05:54.970 --> 05:57.160
How can you be so carefree?

05:57.540 --> 06:00.060
You saw his power.

06:00.060 --> 06:04.620
You don't stand a chance against a Gifted 
Other Worlder in an honest fight.

06:05.090 --> 06:10.890
If you open that door without a plan, 
his beasts will tear you apart.

06:12.620 --> 06:13.840
<i>That's...</i>

06:14.380 --> 06:17.940
<i>I see. So he does have a plan.</i>

06:17.940 --> 06:21.260
All right. Use that bottle of poison 
to reduce the number of—

06:23.660 --> 06:26.570
Looks like we'll have 
to catch him off-guard!

06:27.500 --> 06:30.760
Stay low and follow me. 
There's a back door over—

06:32.500 --> 06:33.740
Excuse me.

06:34.260 --> 06:37.200
<i>This is why I hate Other Worlders!</i>

06:40.020 --> 06:41.380
Suzuki...

06:41.380 --> 06:45.340
Ah, Ysha. Did you request that man's help?

06:46.350 --> 06:48.350
Hello. Nice to meet you.

06:48.780 --> 06:51.590
I'm someone who's interested in you.

06:52.830 --> 06:56.610
I'd like to base a novel on you.

06:56.610 --> 06:59.200
What? A novel?

06:59.200 --> 07:00.310
I see.

07:00.310 --> 07:06.560
You wish to write the heroic tale of Suzuki 
the Hero conquering another world.

07:06.560 --> 07:08.030
No.

07:08.510 --> 07:13.880
A man gains more power than he deserves 
and falls to his own greed.

07:14.330 --> 07:20.120
I am intrigued by your 
profoundly human experience.

07:20.120 --> 07:24.080
Huh? Suzuki-san, 
what's he talking about?

07:24.970 --> 07:26.090
Very well.

07:27.420 --> 07:31.260
<b>A pack of stray 
wolves appeared.</b>

07:27.880 --> 07:31.270
You will die for insulting this hero.

07:33.330 --> 07:35.930
Kill him, my pets.

07:36.370 --> 07:37.380
Be careful!

07:38.410 --> 07:39.350
Hey!

07:39.350 --> 07:41.190
Stand back, fool!

07:41.190 --> 07:42.720
Pointed ray of light!

07:43.100 --> 07:44.180
Billaim!

07:49.680 --> 07:50.860
Damn it!

07:52.060 --> 07:53.920
Time to finish this.

07:53.920 --> 07:55.210
Burn them to death.

07:57.130 --> 07:58.960
This is bad! They're aiming for you!

07:58.960 --> 07:59.830
Take cover!

08:02.730 --> 08:04.260
Sensei!

08:07.560 --> 08:08.390
What?!

08:08.390 --> 08:10.350
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

08:13.660 --> 08:16.960
So it was you, Melos. Thank you.

08:19.590 --> 08:22.340
It even deflects novice-level spells.

08:23.010 --> 08:24.430
I see.

08:24.430 --> 08:28.110
Hot, hot! Hot, hot! Hot, hot!

08:28.110 --> 08:29.800
This is bad, Suzuki-san!

08:29.800 --> 08:30.880
We're out of options!

08:30.880 --> 08:32.370
Stay calm, Kotaro.

08:33.320 --> 08:36.780
<b>A great wolf 
has appeared.</b>

08:33.490 --> 08:36.770
I still have my number one pet.

08:37.110 --> 08:40.750
Be careful. The instant this thing bites you...

08:42.310 --> 08:44.300
you're dead.

08:55.530 --> 09:01.400
Good grief. Dogs should be kept 
chained up at all times.

09:01.720 --> 09:04.840
<i>600 damage inflicted by Sensei's poison.</i>

09:04.110 --> 09:07.210
I-It died instantly!

09:05.210 --> 09:07.560
<i>Sensei has defeated the great wolf.</i>

09:07.830 --> 09:10.380
You infused your own body with poison?

09:10.380 --> 09:12.700
You're unbelievable.

09:14.360 --> 09:16.500
N-No!

09:18.150 --> 09:19.190
Coward.

09:20.410 --> 09:23.590
Come on, Suzuki. Give yourself up.

09:25.300 --> 09:27.820
No, I'm not done yet.

09:31.030 --> 09:35.050
Trump cards are meant to be 
held until the end, right?

09:35.930 --> 09:37.500
Annette!

09:37.930 --> 09:40.470
Kill them, elf woman.

09:44.210 --> 09:46.070
Don't do this, Annette!

09:58.360 --> 10:00.860
We can't fight Annette.

10:00.860 --> 10:02.620
We should retreat for now, Sensei.

10:07.180 --> 10:12.840
Annette-kun isn't as weak as you think.

10:13.890 --> 10:15.210
You fool!

10:15.210 --> 10:19.480
Once someone has been affected by my 
overpowered skill "Pet," it can't be dispelled!

10:19.480 --> 10:22.920
That woman will live as my slave 
for the rest of her life!

10:23.730 --> 10:27.090
That's for her to decide.

10:27.670 --> 10:31.140
You have no say in the matter.

10:36.060 --> 10:40.070
I know you aren't a bird in a cage.

10:40.690 --> 10:43.270
Isn't that right, Annette-kun?

10:54.930 --> 10:59.350
What's wrong? Kill that man, elf woman!

10:59.350 --> 11:01.790
What are you doing?!

11:01.790 --> 11:04.510
Your master is ordering you to kill him!

11:57.750 --> 11:59.930
Sensei...

12:01.240 --> 12:02.170
Hi there.

12:05.910 --> 12:08.330
Could you treat her wounds, Ysha-kun?

12:08.330 --> 12:09.570
R-Right.

12:15.700 --> 12:20.120
<i>Annette-kun isn't as weak as you think.</i>

12:20.650 --> 12:21.910
Annette...

12:23.610 --> 12:27.120
M-My overpowered skill...

12:39.550 --> 12:40.860
Suzuki?!

12:46.330 --> 12:49.570
Don't kill yourself.

12:50.010 --> 12:51.950
Wh-What are you...

12:52.770 --> 12:54.390
Didn't I tell you?

12:54.790 --> 12:59.220
I'm in the middle of 
writing a book about you.

13:00.030 --> 13:01.260
H-Huh?

13:01.260 --> 13:04.480
I can't allow you to end the story early.

13:05.220 --> 13:11.930
Now, tell me your story.

13:13.330 --> 13:17.220
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

13:13.790 --> 13:17.170
Don't Kill 
Yourself

13:17.170 --> 13:18.090
Don't Kill 
Yourself

13:17.220 --> 13:18.090
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

13:22.240 --> 13:24.360
Now, tell me...

13:26.550 --> 13:29.750
your story.

13:31.340 --> 13:33.200
Hey, Pochi-kun.

13:33.200 --> 13:36.620
Didn't I tell you to come 
back in ten minutes?

13:37.760 --> 13:41.290
Stupid dogs need to be disciplined.

13:43.360 --> 13:48.380
<i>I was always timid, and stronger 
guys always made me their pet.</i>

13:51.780 --> 13:56.230
<i>I thought about dying countless times, but...</i>

13:57.340 --> 14:00.950
<i>I didn't even have the courage to do that.</i>

14:08.280 --> 14:11.620
You're in the way, brat! Sheesh.

14:26.480 --> 14:31.730
Suzuki the Hero, 
welcome to Zauberberg.

14:31.730 --> 14:35.480
You have been chosen to save this world.

14:35.750 --> 14:40.510
You must use the Gift granted to you 
to defeat the Wrathful Dark Lord.

14:41.290 --> 14:42.470
Me?

14:44.650 --> 14:46.280
<b>Skill</b>

14:44.650 --> 14:46.280
<b>Total Obedience</b>

14:44.650 --> 14:46.280
<b>(Pet)</b>

14:44.650 --> 14:46.280
<b>Suzuki
Profession: Adventurer
Sex: Male</b>

15:02.810 --> 15:05.750
So this is my power...

15:16.550 --> 15:18.240
Speak of the devil.

15:18.240 --> 15:19.310
Look.

15:25.400 --> 15:27.240
You're in the way, Other Worlder!

15:27.240 --> 15:29.130
You're in the way, brat!

15:34.510 --> 15:38.220
<i>Someone who suffered constant 
failures in his old world</i>

15:38.220 --> 15:41.750
<i>was suddenly granted power and made a hero.</i>

15:41.990 --> 15:45.250
<i>Do you really believe he'd 
save an alien world?</i>

15:47.190 --> 15:51.410
Not that I could even commit evil properly.

15:51.940 --> 15:59.400
No matter what world I inhabit, 
I'm just a weak-willed nobody.

16:01.510 --> 16:03.050
Suzuki...

16:03.810 --> 16:05.510
Marvelous.

16:11.170 --> 16:16.570
My novel based on you 
is finally complete.

16:16.900 --> 16:24.670
It is the story of a miserable man who, 
despite hoping to live as a hero in this world,

16:24.670 --> 16:30.580
could become neither a hero nor 
a villain due to his own weakness.

16:30.580 --> 16:33.890
I call it "No Longer Heroic."

16:35.280 --> 16:36.260
No...

16:36.350 --> 16:38.720
No Longer 
Allowed in 
Another World

16:39.740 --> 16:42.080
"No Longer Allowed in Another World."

16:50.190 --> 16:52.460
Thank you, Suzuki-kun.

16:53.140 --> 16:59.070
Because of you, I was finally able to write 
something I was satisfied with again.

16:59.650 --> 17:07.220
But unfortunately, this cannot 
be called a masterpiece.

17:21.270 --> 17:24.330
Is that a magic circle for 
summoning an Other Worlder?

17:24.330 --> 17:25.820
Why did it show up here now?

17:30.800 --> 17:34.400
The power of teleportation 
is flowing back into it.

17:53.720 --> 17:55.560
I-Impossible!

17:55.870 --> 18:00.450
Did it send the Other Worlder 
back to his own world?

18:00.450 --> 18:02.580
Ysha, look at this.

18:03.320 --> 18:07.800
Sensei definitely didn't have 
a Gift before, but now...

18:04.730 --> 18:08.940
<b>Skill</b>

18:04.730 --> 18:08.940
<b>Writing</b>

18:04.730 --> 18:08.940
<b>(Storyteller)</b>

18:04.730 --> 18:08.940
<b>Poison</b>

18:04.730 --> 18:08.940
<b>(Calmotin)</b>

18:11.730 --> 18:19.440
<i>This is probably a special skill that only 
activates against certain targets: Other Worlders.</i>

18:19.440 --> 18:24.910
<i>Does that mean Sensei was brought to 
this world to fight Other Worlders?</i>

18:30.700 --> 18:33.940
I failed to write my masterpiece again.

18:36.890 --> 18:42.430
Will I find anyone else to 
excite my sensitivities?

18:43.810 --> 18:46.780
<i>Who exactly is this man?</i>

18:48.090 --> 18:51.170
Oh? Where did Suzuki-kun go?

18:51.170 --> 18:55.280
Y-You just sent him back to his world.

18:59.150 --> 19:01.610
The monsters are leaving?

19:01.610 --> 19:03.690
H-Have we been spared?

19:05.580 --> 19:08.120
Beware of Wildcat

19:10.740 --> 19:15.390
Hey! Why was I inside a barrel?!

19:19.610 --> 19:22.920
Here, Sensei. I brought 
the item you asked for.

19:23.420 --> 19:26.760
Thank you, Ysha-kun.

19:28.160 --> 19:31.010
It's exactly what I requested.

19:31.010 --> 19:33.430
I-I'm glad to hear that.

19:33.430 --> 19:36.810
Ysha, thank you so much for all your help.

19:37.330 --> 19:38.350
Annette.

19:39.520 --> 19:40.810
Do you have a moment?

19:44.150 --> 19:49.690
It's possible Sensei has an important role 
to fulfill in the future of this world.

19:50.350 --> 19:53.150
Your journey will be 
difficult and dangerous.

19:55.040 --> 19:56.470
Regardless, I—

19:56.470 --> 19:57.810
So, Annette...

19:58.780 --> 20:02.630
You must support him. I know you can do it.

20:04.520 --> 20:05.440
Of course!

20:08.300 --> 20:10.010
Shall we go?

20:10.320 --> 20:11.230
Yes.

20:12.860 --> 20:14.230
Hey, Sensei.

20:14.630 --> 20:16.530
About Suzuki...

20:16.960 --> 20:27.780
Did he turn out that way because this world 
granted him more power than he deserved?

20:30.570 --> 20:32.090
Who knows?

20:33.050 --> 20:40.970
Will he return to his own world 
and live a miserable life again?

20:41.590 --> 20:48.820
It's true that the story of Suzuki 
the Hero in this world has ended.

20:48.820 --> 20:54.410
But his story in his own world has not.

20:55.480 --> 21:01.000
It's up to him whether it 
becomes a masterpiece or not.

21:04.700 --> 21:07.710
Yes, you're right.

22:45.440 --> 22:47.420
I've looked over your résumé.

22:48.180 --> 22:53.410
You dropped out of school, huh?

22:54.810 --> 22:57.610
May I ask why?

23:05.920 --> 23:07.260
Are you okay?

23:08.420 --> 23:11.070
Sorry if it's hard for you to talk about.

23:11.070 --> 23:12.430
N-No, um...

23:12.430 --> 23:14.800
Well, you start tomorrow.

23:15.410 --> 23:16.350
Okay.

23:36.310 --> 23:39.930
To Be Continued
